   "text": "A BIG TEAM\n(about 100k messages a year)\n\nRead everything:\n3-6 h  ·  ~$4-7  ·  3-5 GB\n\n30-day window:\nabout 8k messages, ready in minutes\na few cents  ·  small disk",
